The lightbox cancel endpoint accepted GET requests (no CSRF protection) and cancelled the checkout session's
last order of any payment method without checking that the given Datatrans transaction belongs to it;
orders that could not be cancelled (e.g. paid/invoiced) were force-set to canceled.
Allow POST only and cancel only a pending_payment order that owns the given transaction.

